    "summary": "Errata to Grey Knights datasheets. Toughness becomes:\n\n- 6 for Grand Master, Paladin Squad, Grand Master Voldus, Brotherhood Terminator Squad, Brotherhood Librarian, Brotherhood Chaplain and Brother-Captain\n- 5 for Strike Squad, Purifier Squad, Purgation Squad, Interceptor Squad, Castellan Crowe, Brotherhood Techmarine and Brotherhood Champion\n- 9 for Nemesis Dreadknight and Grand Master in Nemesis Dreadknight\n\nWeapons change as follows:\n\n- close combat weapons of Strike Squad, Purifier Squad, Purgation Squad and Interceptor Squad: Strength 5\n- Brotherhood Librarian's combi-weapon: Strength 5, AP -1\n- Stormraven Gunship's hurricane bolter: Strength 5, AP -1\n- storm bolters of Venerable Dreadnought, Strike Squad, Rhino, Land Raider Redeemer, Land Raider Crusader, Razorback, Purifier Squad, Purgation Squad, Paladin Squad, Land Raider, Interceptor Squad, Grand Master Voldus, Castellan Crowe, Grand Master, Brotherhood Terminator Squad, Brotherhood Librarian, Brotherhood Chaplain, Brotherhood Champion and Brother-Captain: Strength 5, AP -1",
